body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1354\n\nReporter verified direct Node test success and linked snapshot failure (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND), with a root-dependency positive control, on published 2026.9.29. Current-tree reproduction and implementation are pending.\n\nRequested contract: Snapshot execution retains correct root and nested package dependency resolution with distinct versions while preserving both tracker sandboxes and documented no-writeback boundaries.\n\nVerification plan: reproduce the public report in a temporary project outside this checkout with both PM roots isolated, demonstrate a relevant regression, then validate the SDK boundary, thin transport where applicable, complete coverage and packed consumers. No implementation is included in PR #1353."
